From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:23:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(sim): judge spot drill cones at the part top

Use the measured source top for ordinary drill rim checks. Keep stock height for rapid and collision checks. Pin safe spots and real wall cuts below extra stock. Correct the stale catalog assertion inherited from the required parent stack.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3451
